1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,171
Outreach gets messy
fast.

2
00:00:02,226 --> 00:00:03,501
Who did I message?

3
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:04,603
What did I say?

4
00:00:04,636 --> 00:00:06,619
Who needs a follow-up
today?

5
00:00:06,681 --> 00:00:09,018
If the answer lives in
your head,

6
00:00:09,091 --> 00:00:10,224
you will forget.

7
00:00:10,259 --> 00:00:13,164
So I'm building the tool
that answers it.

8
00:00:13,253 --> 00:00:14,954
This is my Today screen.

9
00:00:15,006 --> 00:00:16,069
Follow-ups due.

10
00:00:16,102 --> 00:00:16,952
Who replied.

11
00:00:16,978 --> 00:00:18,112
What to do next.

12
00:00:18,147 --> 00:00:21,193
Every business has a
stage in the pipeline,

13
00:00:21,287 --> 00:00:23,979
and a full history I can
step through,

14
00:00:24,062 --> 00:00:25,125
event by event.

15
00:00:25,158 --> 00:00:27,424
It doesn't send anything
for me,

16
00:00:27,495 --> 00:00:28,982
and it doesn't guess.

17
00:00:29,028 --> 00:00:30,516
It records what I do,

18
00:00:30,562 --> 00:00:32,616
and shows me what I
recorded.

19
00:00:32,680 --> 00:00:35,443
I'm building it around
my own outreach,

20
00:00:35,528 --> 00:00:37,653
and I'll tell you if it
works.

21
00:00:37,719 --> 00:00:38,711
Andrew Builds.

